// VibeMail — agentic mail, rebuilt from the deep-space web reference
// (UI设计/app: dark #05070f ground, violet #8642ff agent accent, cyan
// #22d3ee data accent, AI priority meters, label chips, Agent squad).
// Three views — 智能收件箱 (triage banner + filter chips + priority rows),
// AI 写信 (tone toolbar + AI draft box + prompt panel), Agent 小队 (stats,
// squad cards, autonomy dial, live activity stream). The reply lifecycle
// lives on the mail itself (draft -> confirm -> sending -> sent / failed ->
// retry) so every surface reads one state. AI summary and drafting call the
// host's one-shot model service (model.complete, OctoSense#95) with a
// schema-checked answer; where nothing answers "model" (card-host) the app
// says so and falls back to labelled practice content. Mail data and sends
// are practice data until a platform mail service answers.

// ---- state ---------------------------------------------------------------
let screen = "inbox"          // inbox | write | agents (desktop: reading is
                              // a selection in the inbox's master-detail)
let current = 0
let selected = false          // no mail focused -> placeholder pane
let filter = "all"            // all | urgent | reply | later

// Practice mails mirror the web reference's dataset. Every literal carries
// the full field set (the runtime errors on missing fields), including the
// reply-lifecycle state the read/compose screens mutate.
